        "title": "Introduzione alle media query",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 147820,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le media query aiutano l'interfaccia del tuo gioco ad avere un bell'aspetto su schermi diversi applicando stili differenti in base a fattori come la larghezza.</p><p>Iniziamo a creare una media query usando <code>@media</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"link\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"rel\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;stylesheet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;style.css&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Pixel Quest HUD\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Health and score should fit every screen.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><code name=\"style.css\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"css\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"1\" /><option startIndex=\"1\" endIndex=\"6\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"@\" /><text value=\"media\" class=\"keyword\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>@</code>, seguito da <code>media</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 147821,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le media query possono avere come target larghezze e altezze specifiche dello schermo, regolando di conseguenza gli stili.<br /><br /></p><p>Possiamo definire una condizione per quando la viewport è di 1200 pixel o meno.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"link\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"rel\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;stylesheet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;style.css&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Pixel Quest HUD\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Keep the UI readable while you dodge enemies.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><code name=\"style.css\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"css\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"24\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"@media(max-width: 1200px) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>max-width</code>, seguito da <code>:</code> e infine <code>1200px</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 147822,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>All'interno della media query, possiamo definire le nostre regole CSS. Aggiungi una regola per impostare il colore di sfondo per tutti i dispositivi con una larghezza inferiore a 1.200 px.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"link\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"rel\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;stylesheet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;style.css&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Pixel Quest HUD\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Your HUD adapts as the game screen shrinks.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><code name=\"style.css\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"css\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"33\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"@media(max-width: 1200px) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" body {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  background-color: black;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  color: lime;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>body</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 147823,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo anche combinare più condizioni. Prova a impostare il colore di sfondo solo quando il browser ha una larghezza compresa tra 200 e 1.200 px.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"link\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"rel\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;stylesheet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;style.css&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Dungeon Run\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Shrink the screen and watch the UI adapt.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><code name=\"style.css\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"css\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"39\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"@media(min-width: 200px) and (max-width: 1200px) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" body {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  background-color: black;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  color: lime;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>min-width</code>, seguito da <code>max-width</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 147824,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Puoi aggiungere tutte le regole che vuoi alla query <code>@media</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"link\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"rel\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;stylesheet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;style.css&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Space Shooter UI\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Health, score, and ammo should stay readable.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><code name=\"style.css\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"css\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"116\" endIndex=\"117\" /><option startIndex=\"122\" endIndex=\"123\" /><option startIndex=\"164\" endIndex=\"165\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"@media(max-width: 1200px) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" body {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  background-color: #111111;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" h1 {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  font-family: Arial;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  color: #00ffcc;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" p {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  color: #ffffff;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  font-weight: bold;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>{</code>, seguito da <code>}</code> e poi <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 147825,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Puoi anche aggiungere più query <code>@media</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"link\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"rel\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;stylesheet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;style.css&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Boss Fight Overlay\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Different screens need different HUD sizes.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;250&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/r/venn.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><code name=\"style.css\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"css\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"76\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"77\" /><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"95\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"@media(max-width: 200px) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" body {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  background-color: #222222;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"@media(max-width: 2400px) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" h1 {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  font-family: Arial;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  color: #ffcc00;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>@media</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e poi <code>max-width: 2400px</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 147826,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando più regole CSS hanno come obiettivo lo stesso elemento, prevale la regola dichiarata più avanti nel foglio di stile o con una specificità maggiore.</p><p>Le media query seguono gli stessi principi di sovrascrittura.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"meta\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"charset\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;UTF-8&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"meta\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;viewport&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"content\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"title\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Neon Arena\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"title\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"link\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"rel\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;stylesheet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;style.css&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Neon Arena HUD\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Your UI colors can change by screen size.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><code name=\"style.css\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"css\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"2\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"56\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"h1 {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" color: #66ffcc;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"@media(max-width: 2400px) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" h1 {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  color: #0066ff;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>h1</code>, seguito da <code>h1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 147827,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché usiamo le media query CSS?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Applicare stili diversi per dispositivi diversi (come computer desktop, tablet e telefoni)</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Per velocizzare l'esecuzione della logica del gioco</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Applicare stili diversi per dispositivi diversi (come computer desktop, tablet e telefoni).</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 147828,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa c'è che non va in questo codice?</p><code name=\"style.css\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"css\"><content><text value=\"@\" /><text value=\"media\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" screen and (min-width: \" /><text value=\"600px\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"selector-tag\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"background-color\" class=\"attribute\" /><text value=\": black;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"color\" class=\"attribute\" /><text value=\": lime;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"selector-tag\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"font-size\" class=\"attribute\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"200%\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Alla query <code>@media</code> manca la parentesi graffa di chiusura</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Non possiamo aggiungere due regole a una query <code>@media</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Alla query <code>@media</code> manca la parentesi graffa di chiusura.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 147829,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cosa succede quando aggiungiamo una media query per garantire che gli stili vengano applicati solo agli schermi larghi meno di 600px?</p><code name=\"style.css\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"css\"><content><text value=\"@\" /><text value=\"media\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" screen and (max-width: \" /><text value=\"600px\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"selector-tag\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"background-color\" class=\"attribute\" /><text value=\": black;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Gli stili all'interno della media query si applicano solo quando la larghezza dello schermo è inferiore a 600px</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Gli stili all'interno della media query si applicano agli schermi di tutte le dimensioni</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gli stili all'interno della media query si applicano solo quando la larghezza dello schermo è inferiore a 600px.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 147830,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quante regole possiamo aggiungere alla nostra query <code>@media</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Quanti ne vogliamo</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Solo uno</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Quanti ne vogliamo.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 147831,
